        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-314147",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Artificial Intelligence - With Artificial Intelligence (AI), we believe our reflow oven systems have leading market share with Outsourced Semiconductor Assembly and Test Services (OSATS) providers who perform advanced packaging of the AI chips.",
        "start_character": 6959,
        "end_character": 7203
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-314147",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-314147-a78f44325c09e977",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-314147",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Customer-centric product development in R&D: We continue to invest in research and development to expand our Thermal Processing Solutions reflow equipment product-line for AI applications.",
        "start_character": 8183,
        "end_character": 8371
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-314147",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-314147-a78f44325c09e977",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-314147",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our business is not seasonal in nature, but is cyclical based on the capital equipment investment patterns of semiconductor manufacturers.",
        "start_character": 23167,
        "end_character": 23305
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-314147",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-314147-a78f44325c09e977",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-314147",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Semi-Fabless Manufacturing Model: We have migrated to a semi-fabless manufacturing model for the majority of our capital equipment business to improve our ability to scale production and reduce fixed costs.",
        "start_character": 8731,
        "end_character": 8937
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-314147",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-314147-a78f44325c09e977",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-314147",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To continue producing and delivering high-quality products and services to our customers, and to compete and succeed in the highly competitive and continually evolving markets in which we operate, it is critical that we continue to attract, retain and develop a diverse group of talented individuals at all levels of our organization.",
        "start_character": 31999,
        "end_character": 32333
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-314147",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-314147-a78f44325c09e977",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-314147",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are also investing in application development and R&D resources to accelerate growth of our Semiconductor Fabrications Solutions business by expanding our consumables product portfolio and providing exceptional technical support and service to customers.",
        "start_character": 8473,
        "end_character": 8730
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-314147",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-314147-a78f44325c09e977",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-314147",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our product portfolio, developed through a track record of technological innovation as well as the integration of key acquisitions, provides exceptional value to semiconductor manufacturing by increasing yields, efficiency and throughput.",
        "start_character": 4564,
        "end_character": 4813
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-314147",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-314147-a78f44325c09e977",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-314147",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe the continued expansion of our consumable and after-market product offerings, primarily in our Semiconductor Fabrication Solutions segment, will enable us to partially offset some of these cyclical effects.",
        "start_character": 10586,
        "end_character": 10803
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-314147",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-314147-a78f44325c09e977",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-314147",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-10",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe we are uniquely positioned in that our products are employed throughout the early and late stages of semiconductor and electronics manufacturing.",
        "start_character": 2314,
        "end_character": 2470
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-314147",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-314147-a78f44325c09e977",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-314147",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We plan to continue to develop new products and invest in upgrades to existing products to stay competitive in the markets we serve.",
        "start_character": 26846,
        "end_character": 26978
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-314147",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-314147-a78f44325c09e977",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-314147",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-10",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide equipment, consumables and services for semiconductor device packaging, wafer production and device fabrication.",
        "start_character": 29,
        "end_character": 152
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-25-314147",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-25-314147-a78f44325c09e977",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-25-314147",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-10",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We sell these products to semiconductor device packaging, electronic assembly and device fabrication companies worldwide.",
        "start_character": 389,
        "end_character": 510
      }
